# PomoFocus Workspace — Cursor Rules

# MANDATORY UI/UX PLAYBOOK DIRECTIVE:
Before modifying any UI/UX components, layouts, Tailwind styles, or animations, you MUST read and cross-reference:
docs/UI_UX_DESIGN_PLAYBOOK_AND_POSTMORTEM.md

# CORE INVARIANTS:
1. Z-Index Hierarchy: Follow the centralized Z-Index table. Never render 2 parallel menu components. Use State Singularity (e.g. isHeaderExpanded).
2. Cloud-First: AI Chat, Credits, Tasks, Notes, and User Profiles MUST persist to Supabase Cloud for cross-device sync. Never trap user data in localStorage.
3. Founder Privilege: Always use hasVipAccess(user) and OWNER_EMAILS whitelist (namho03052k9@gmail.com, huyentrantt09@gmail.com). Never show upgrade paywalls to Founders.
4. Layout Flow: Header collapsed = pt-3, Header expanded = pt-14. Bottom mobile content must have pb-28 safe area padding.
5. Visual Elegance: Clean comparisons (✓ and —). Zero negative ❌ emojis.
